  IconPath: icons/weapons/swords/scimitar-guard-gold.webp
  Description: "Usage a weapon in the sword or knife group, or a melee unarmed attack
    that deals slashing damage This blade glitters with such sharpness it seems to
    cut the very air in front of it. Immanence Strikes with the gleaming blade deal
    2 additional spirit damage per weapon damage die. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Flowing
    Spirit Strike] 2 (spirit, transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.6xWX8Ey5ShAyj1HO
